    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. Founders"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Who are the founders?**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Dr. Kenny Aladefa MD, MBA, OLY"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Technical Work:** Who writes code, or does other technical work on your product? Was any of it done by a non-founder? Please explain."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-8",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The technical work is a shared effort between non-founder Lawan Aladefa and non-founder Sample User. Specifically, Lawan uses his no/low-code design engineering skills to iterate and produce the UX architecture and front-end design, while Useron, who specializes in full-stack application design and development, assists in translating the designs into a living application built on top of a back-end architecture. Although they are not founders will be compensating them more than properly for their efforts based on their respective business/labor expenses."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Cofounder Search:** Are you looking for a cofounder?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-11",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Not at the moment"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. Founder Video"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Video Instructions:** Please record a one minute video introducing the founder(s). Make sure the file does not exceed 100 MB. ([examples](https://www.ycombinator.com/video))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "[Imhotep RX Founder Video.mp4](YC%20Application%20Template/Imhotep_RX_Founder_Video.mp4)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. Company"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Company Name:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-20",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "ImhotepRX"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Company Description (50 chars max):** Describe what your company does in 50 characters or less."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-23",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "ImhotepRx: AI-driven patient diagnostics & care."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Company website URL:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-26",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Imhotepai.org"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Demo Upload:** If you have a demo, attach it below. Anything that shows us how the product works. Please limit to 3 minutes / 100 MB."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-29",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "[ImhotepRX Diagnostic Tool Concept Demo.mov](YC%20Application%20Template/ImhotepRX_Diagnostic_Tool_Concept_Demo.mov)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-30",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Product Link:** Please provide a link to the product, if any."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-32",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-31",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "[https://imhoteprx.vercel.app/](https://imhoteprx.vercel.app/) with fake-email: [demo@imhoteprx.com](mailto:demo@imhoteprx.com) and password 1mh0t3p!"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-33",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Product Description:** What is your company going to make? Please describe your product and what it does or will do."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-35",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-34",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "We are creating an AI-powered healthcare app designed to empower patients and clinicians while streamlining the diagnostic process. Its unique selling point is the combination of advanced natural language processing, dynamic anatomical imaging, and a suite of other helpful features, providing tailored, real-time feedback to both patients and clinicians."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-36",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Location:** Where do you live now, and where would the company be based after YC? Use the format City A, Country A / City B, Country B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-38",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-37",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Los Angeles, USA / Lagos, Nigeria"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-39",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Location Decision:** Explain your decision regarding location."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-41",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-40",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "ImhotepRX is part of our larger mission to improve the health and well-being of communities across Africa through our company, Unity Health Pharmaceutical Ltd, based in Nigeria. Currently, everything is remote, with Dr. Kenny handling most of the networking and pitching from Los Angeles, California, USA."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-42",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. Progress"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-43",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-44",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Progress:** How far along are you?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-46",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-45",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "To date, we’ve completed an interactive mockup showcasing user flows at a high level and a landing page, which we’re using to attract potential investors and secure seed funding to accelerate bringing the product to market."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-47",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Time Commitment:** How long have each of you been working on this? How much of that has been full-time? Please explain."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-49",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-48",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Dr. Kenny has been working full-time on this project for a year while also balancing his responsibilities as a husband and dad. Lawan joined at the six-month mark, initially working part-time while doing warehouse work during the day, but recently left his job in December 2024 to commit full-time. Useron joined the efforts part-time at the 4 month mark by request of Lawan as they’ve collaborated on other development projects together in the past."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Tech Stack:** What tech stack are you using, or planning to use, to build this product?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-52",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-51",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "At the moment aiming for an approach that is iterative and low-code for design and development. Currently we’re planning around a Figma informed, Flutter-Flow driven, Xcode compiled, and a Firebase supported tech stack."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-53",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Users:** Are people using your product?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-56",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-54",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "[ ]  Yes"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-55",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "[x]  No"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-57",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**When will you have a version people can use?**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-59",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-58",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Ideally by early or mid 2026 depending on funding"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-60",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Revenue:** Do you have revenue?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-63",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-61",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "[ ]  Yes"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-62",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "[x]  No"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-64",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Previous Application:** If you are applying with the same idea as a previous batch, did anything change? If you applied with a different idea, why did you pivot and what did you learn from the last idea?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-66",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-65",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "n/a"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-67",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Incubator/Accelerator:** If you have already participated or committed to participate in an incubator, \"accelerator\" or \"pre-accelerator\" program, please tell us about it."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-69",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-68",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "n/a"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-70",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. Idea"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-71",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-72",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Idea Choice:** Why did you pick this idea to work on? Do you have domain expertise in this area? How do you know people need what you're making?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-74",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-73",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "We chose to work on ImhotepRx because it addresses critical healthcare challenges in Africa, including diagnostic accuracy and limited access to reliable medical information. Dr. Kenny brings over 20 years of experience in healthcare and leverages his MBA, business acumen, and networking skills, while Lawan applies his digital design and production expertise to bring ImhotepRx to life. We know people need a tool like ImhotepRx because current statistics reveal the inadequacies of healthcare infrastructures. Many are losing their lives to preventable diseases and conditions due to the inability to reliably diagnose symptoms or verify the legitimacy of medications, and ImhotepRx aims to help resolve these issues."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-75",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Competitors:** Who are your competitors? What do you understand about your business that they don't?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-77",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-76",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "We have no direct competitors because no other tool combines anatomy, physiology, pathophysiology, pharmacological interventions, counterfeit drug verification, and a diagnostic tool, all simplified so that anyone, whether a medical professional or not, can learn about their health concerns."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-78",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Monetization:** How do or will you make money? How much could you make? (We realize you can't know precisely, but give your best estimate)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-80",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-79",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "We will use a simple app subscription model. Free version that has most of the functionalities present, and a paid version for healthcare/medical professionals and company/educational institution with access to industry tailored tools."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-81",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Category:** Which category best applies to your company? (Select one)"
        }
      ]
    },
