        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-127",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "*You're being asked the following questions because you selected the category Healthcare.*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-128",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Please describe the scientific basis for your product. How does it work?**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-129",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "(It's best if you address your answer to a scientist, but one who is not a specialist in your field)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-131",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-130",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "ImhotepRx is an AI-powered healthcare platform designed to improve diagnostic accuracy and streamline patient care. The scientific basis for our product lies in combining natural language processing (NLP), anatomical imaging, and machine learning (ML)  aimed to be trained on healthcare/medical databases to enhance how healthcare professionals diagnose and treat patients, especially in regions with limited resources."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-132",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Describe the next few stages in developing your product. For each stage, how much time and money will it take?**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-133",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. Reach out for strategic partnerships to increase networking and funding opportunities / until we get in connection with those aligned with our goals"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-134",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. Continued developing and setting the foundations for a robust mvp / 6 months minimum"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-135",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**If you were accepted into YC, what could you accomplish by Demo Day?**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-136",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. A functional mvp of the app that would be ready to handle data from larger medical databases"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-137",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. A clear delineation between CI/CD deployments and version 2.0 functions for the design and development team"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-138",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. A more refined marketing and strategic partnerships plan granted the new exposure to the YC network"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-139",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Does your product need regulatory approval (i.e., FDA)? If so, what is the approval process? What is your plan to get approved, and how much time and money will it take?**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-141",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-140",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "ImhotepRx does not require FDA approval as it is not a medical device or drug, but rather a software-based diagnostic and healthcare support tool. However, given the nature of the product and its potential impact on patient care, regulatory approval may be required in certain African countries depending on local health regulations and classifications of healthcare-related technologies."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-142",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**What experimental data (if any) do you have showing that this would work?**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-144",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-143",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "n/a"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-145",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Other Ideas:** If you had any other ideas you considered applying with, please list them. One may be something we've been waiting for. Often when we fund people it's to do something they list here and not in the main application."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-147",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-146",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "n/a"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
