        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-164",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Application Motivation:** What convinced you to apply to Y Combinator? Did someone encourage you to apply? Have you been to any YC events?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-166",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-165",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "What convinced us to apply to YC was the opportunity to secure the seed funding we needed that would support both the design and development of ImhotepRx and our broader goal of creating a modern medical infrastructure that other African countries can optimize and implement for their people."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-167",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**How did you hear about YC?:** How did you hear about Y Combinator?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-169",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-168",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Useron and Lawan suggested it as a potential opportunity."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
